# LOCAL web pointed at the PROD server's API (https://book-nest.net).
# USE WITH CARE — every request hits REAL production data through the live API.
# Usage:  pnpm dev:web:prod         (loads .env.prod via dotenv-cli, runs next dev)
# Copy this file to .env.prod. .env.prod is gitignored.
# Field docs live in .env.local.example — this file only notes what differs for prod.
#
# Only API_BASE_URL changes (same mechanism as .env.dev.example). The same
# cookie caveat applies — prod cookies are Secure and scoped to book-nest.net,
# so sign-in may not persist through the localhost proxy.

NEXT_PUBLIC_API_BASE_URL=
API_BASE_URL=https://book-nest.net
NEXT_PUBLIC_SITE_URL=http://localhost:3000
